{"id":"n1-054","title":"Noun なりとも (~nari tomo)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Indicates even a small amount or degree; 'at least', 'even a little'.","longExplanation":"Noun + なりとも is used to show that even a small amount or degree is valuable or needed. It translates as 'at least' or 'even a little' in English.","formation":"Noun + なりとも","examples":[{"jp":"時間が限られているので、一時間なりとも練習すべきだ。","romaji":"Jikan ga kagirarete iru node, ichi-jikan nari tomo renshuu subeki da.","en":"Since time is limited, you should practice for at least an hour.","words":[{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"限ら","vocabId":"1264640","reading":"かぎる"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"ので","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一","vocabId":"1160790","reading":"いち"},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"練習","vocabId":"1559160","reading":"れんしゅう"},{"surface":"す","vocabId":"1400390","reading":"す"},{"surface":"べき","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼には一言なりとも謝罪の言葉を聞きたい。","romaji":"Kare ni wa hitokoto nari tomo shazai no kotoba o kikitai.","en":"I’d like to hear at least a word of apology from him.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一言","vocabId":"1575990","reading":"ひとこと"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"謝罪","vocabId":"1323030","reading":"しゃざい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言葉","vocabId":"1264540","reading":"ことば"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞き","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きく"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"このプロジェクトには、一人なりともメンバーが必要だ。","romaji":"Kono purojekuto ni wa, hitori nari tomo membaa ga hitsuyou da.","en":"We need at least one member for this project.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プロジェクト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一","vocabId":"1160790","reading":"いち"},{"surface":"人","vocabId":"1580640","reading":"ひと"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"メンバー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"必要","vocabId":"1487660","reading":"ひつよう"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"あなたには、一言なりとも感謝の言葉を述べたい。","romaji":"Anata ni wa, hitokoto nari tomo kansha no kotoba o nobetai.","en":"I want to offer at least a word of gratitude to you.","words":[{"surface":"あなた","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一言","vocabId":"1575990","reading":"ひとこと"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"感謝","vocabId":"1212380","reading":"かんしゃ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言葉","vocabId":"1264540","reading":"ことば"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"述べ","vocabId":"1340820","reading":"のべる"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}